<title>HONG KONG: Argo Pantes unit sets US$30 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Argo Pantes unit sets US$30 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Argo Pantes Finance BV, a wholly-owned subsidiary of PT Argo Pantes, has launched a US$30 million floating-rate note issue, arranger Sanwa International Finance said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The three-year notes, guaranteed by PT Argo Pantes, are priced at par to float at 150 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Fees are 100 basis points for managers committing US$5 million, and replies are due by July 7. Payment date is July 16.</p>
<p>The issue is under the borrower's US$250 million global medium-term note programme.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
